    "chunk_text": "\u00fea ne w\u00e6s he hw\u00e6\u00f0re oht ofor \u00fean in \u00d0a he \u00f0a h\u00e6fde eahtatyne wintra, \u00f0a gefullade hine man \u00e6fter cirican endebyrdnesse. W\u00e6s he \u00e6r beforan \u00fea \u00fereo gear gecristnod, swa ic \u00e6r s\u00e6gde. \u00d0a forlet he ealne \u00feone woruldfolgo\u00f0 an, & \u00f0a gewat he to sancte Ilario \u00feam bisceope, \u00fee in W\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0e forem\u00e6re man, se bisceop, & his god w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gecy\u00f0ed. & he \u00fea \u00feysne eadigan wer sancte Martine fulfremedlice in Godes \u00e6 & in Godes \u00feeowdome getyde & W\u00e6s he swi\u00f0e ge\u00feungen on his \u00feeawum, & gest\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0ig on his wordum, & hluttor & \u00e6rf\u00e6st & cl\u00e6ne on & \u00fea gelamp \u00e6fter \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees eadiga wer sanctus Martinus sum mynster him getimbrade, & he on & \u00fea gelamp sume si\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r cwom sum gecristnod man to him \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde mid his lare & mid his & \u00fea he \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6s wel manige dagas, \u00fea wear\u00f0 he untrum, se man, in \u00fe\u00e6re feferadle. & \u00fea gelamp in \u00f0a tid \u00fe\u00e6t he, sanctus Martinus, w\u00e6s in sumre fore ealle dogor. \u00dea he \u00f0a eft ham cwom, \u00fea mette he \u00feone man for\u00f0feredne \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6r untrum w\u00e6s, & hine efne swa \u00d0a he \u00f0a, sanctus Martinus, \u00fe\u00e6t geseah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea o\u00f0re bro\u00f0or ealle swa unrote leton ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t lic, & hie W\u00e6s him \u00fe\u00e6t swi",
